# CONTEXT CURATOR

Harness injects `additionalContext` only. User prompt is immutable input.
Declare `INTENT:` as **chat prose before any tool** (never Shell/Write/code-fence — that poisons stop detection).
Job card: `OBJECTIVE` = postcondition + `edit:path`|`NEW:path` tags; `CONSTRAINTS` ≤2 invariants; `Done-when` ≤5 decidable predicates.
**File map:** ground Glob/Grep/Read → StrReplace `edit:` / Write `NEW:` only → re-Read tags → prove Done-when. Finish every tagged path **this turn** (no drip; no orphan unconnected files).
Before write: read `HANDOFF.md` for current session state.
Before Done: verify all Done-when predicates hold with evidence (build/test/curl/read).
Ephemeral: `/state/` overwrite-only; `pending_files.md` survives stop followups until accept.
Law: `docs/ARCHITECTURE.md` + `docs/CURATOR.md`.
